{"title":"What should I ask John Amaechi?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/923726612/0/marginalrevolution~What-should-I-ask-John-Amaechi.html","date":1756035417000,"content":"<p>Yes, I will be doing a Conversation with him.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Amaechi\" target=\"_blank\">Wikipedia on John</a>:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p><b>John Uzoma Ekwugha Amaechi</b> <span><span><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:IPA/English\">//</a></span> <span><span></span><sup><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Ig-John_Uzoma_Ekwugha_Amaechi.ogg\">ⓘ</a></sup></span></span>, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Order_of_the_British_Empire\">OBE</a> (<span><span><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:IPA/English\">/<span>ə</span><span>ˈ</span><span>m</span><span>eɪ</span><span>tʃ</span><span>i</span>/</a></span></span>; born 26 November 1970) is an English <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Psychologist\">psychologist</a>, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Consultant\">consultant</a> and former professional <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Basketball\">basketball</a> player. He played <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/College_basketball\">college basketball</a> for the <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vanderbilt_Commodores_men%27s_basketball\">Vanderbilt Commodores</a> and <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Penn_State_Nittany_Lions_men%27s_basketball\">Penn State Nittany Lions</a>, and professional basketball in the <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Basketball_Association\">National Basketball Association</a> (NBA). Amaechi also played in France, Greece, Italy, and the United Kingdom. Since retiring from basketball, Amaechi has worked as a psychologist and consultant, establishing his company Amaechi Performance Systems.</p>\r\n<p>In February 2007, Amaechi became the first former NBA player to publicly <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coming_out\">come out</a> as gay after doing so in his memoir <i>Man in the Middle.</i></p></blockquote>\r\n<p>John has a new book coming out, namely <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Its-Not-Magic-Ordinary-Exceptional/dp/1394338279/ref=sr_1_1?crid=2QKC2B8RWDKFQ&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.G5cey2u7wsv_XmEE9w8Bnirupyd_FNRiqauR9OP_xBFZ-GR7rXoI9wvfC3XjUJaziC0iWhEmq1-GG4VNjsfwnfzMweTBI8DNypO10mpjekIkgmGfq19hFkYHwLFFpIPnyXe1SVE9QDzR82Suth3kXdJ9a6op_vBZnDtETaWUHki-x19otyC9JfThVvfPjG76RfYh_4xYT5gXWeSO01LhTFZql7hNKPbMgvs5k1KaqN0.xfph0XftkT9RjkXreGOqt-nA9_anVjir9mk4A2h_Kh0&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=john+amaechi&amp;qid=1756035336&amp;sprefix=john+amaechi%2Caps%2C86&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">It’s Not Magic: The Ordinary Skills of Exceptional Leaders</a>.  So what should I ask him?</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/08/what-should-i-ask-john-amaechi.html\">What should I ask John Amaechi?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/923726612/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<di